@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
title WorkPulse – зависимости пакетов ЛР8
package "WorkPulse.Domain" as domain
package "WorkPulse.Application" as app
package "WorkPulse.Demo" as demo
package "WorkPulse.Tests" as tests
app ..> domain
demo ..> app
tests ..> app
note bottom of domain
Без зависимостей от HTTP, EF Core и PostgreSQL.
Схему database/migrations эти библиотеки не изменяют.
end note
@enduml
